                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُلِّىَ أَباَهُ</span></b> 
                        : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَبِسَ أَبَاهُ</span> in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لبس</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُلِّيتُ فُلاَبًا</span>
                        <i>I was made to live long with such a
one.</i> (Ham, p. 412.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلَّاكَ ٱللّٰهُ حَبِيبَكَ</span>
                        <i>May
God make thee to have enjoyment of thy friend</i>
(<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَتَّعَكَ بِهِ</span>) <i>and to live long with him.</i> (S.) See
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَبِسَ</span>.

